</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 4: </span>The effectiveness of <span id="S5.F4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Secret</span> after varying the retrieval settings. The dataset is HealthcareMagic-101 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib60" title="" class="ltx_ref">60</a>]</cite>.</figcaption>
</figure>
